    <item>
      <title>Animation - UIKit</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/animation-uikit/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 May 2024 06:31:02 +0300</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/animation-uikit/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;introduction&#34;&gt;Introduction&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I was curious about creating animations in UIKit. I wanted to animate different properties such as &lt;code&gt;color&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;path&lt;/code&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; id=&#34;zoomCheck-3215a&#34; hidden&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;zoomCheck-3215a&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img class=&#34;zoomCheck&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34; &#xA;            src=&#34;images/0.gif#center&#34; alt=&#34;alt image&#34; &#xA;             /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here is what I found:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It’s impossible to create complex animations only by using the &lt;a href=&#34;https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit/uiview#1654491&#34;&gt;block-based animation API&lt;/a&gt;. To do that, you need the &lt;a href=&#34;https://developer.apple.com/documentation/quartzcore&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Core Animation&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; API and &lt;a href=&#34;https://developer.apple.com/documentation/quartzcore/capropertyanimation/&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;CAPropertyAnimation&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; with its various subclasses.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Complex animation in UIKit is based on a few key components:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://developer.apple.com/documentation/quartzcore/cashapelayer&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;CAShapeLayer&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - provides extensive customization options: &lt;code&gt;path&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;stroke&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;fill&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;shadow&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://developer.apple.com/documentation/quartzcore/cabasicanimation&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;CABasicAnimation&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - helps animate &lt;code&gt;color&lt;/code&gt; or change the &lt;code&gt;path&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;implementation&#34;&gt;Implementation&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;first-step&#34;&gt;First Step&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The first step is to create a shape layer that will draw an arrow using &lt;a href=&#34;https://developer.apple.com/documentation/quartzcore/cashapelayer&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;CAShapeLayer&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Animation - SwiftUI</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/animation-swiftui/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 17 May 2024 07:23:46 +0300</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/animation-swiftui/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;introduction&#34;&gt;Introduction&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I was eager to learn about creating complex animations in SwiftUI. The few questions that were on my mind included what types of animations exist and what I can animate. Here is what I found:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;types-of-animation&#34;&gt;Types of Animation&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;SwiftUI has &lt;code&gt;explicit&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;implicit&lt;/code&gt; animation types.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implicit Animation:&lt;/strong&gt; This is specified with the &lt;code&gt;.animation()&lt;/code&gt; modifier. SwiftUI will animate changes in old and new values.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-swift&#34; data-lang=&#34;swift&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;struct&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nc&#34;&gt;ImplicitAnimation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;View&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;@&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;State&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;private&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;half&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kc&#34;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;@&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;State&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;private&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;dim&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kc&#34;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;some&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;View&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;Image&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;tower&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;            &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;scaleEffect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;half&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mf&#34;&gt;0.5&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mf&#34;&gt;1.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;            &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;opacity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;dim&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mf&#34;&gt;0.2&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mf&#34;&gt;1.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;            &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;animation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;easeInOut&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;duration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;mf&#34;&gt;1.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;            &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;onTapGesture&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;                &lt;span class=&#34;kc&#34;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;dim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;toggle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;                &lt;span class=&#34;kc&#34;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;half&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;toggle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;            &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; id=&#34;zoomCheck-f4c55&#34; hidden&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;zoomCheck-f4c55&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img class=&#34;zoomCheck&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34; &#xA;            src=&#34;images/implicit.gif#center&#34; alt=&#34;Implicit Animation&#34; &#xA;             /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/label&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
